{
    "title": "Gaming Mode - Game Booster PRO",
    "description": "Ultimate Game Mode.\r\nPlay your favorite games like a PRO. Use our game booster and enjoy a fantastic gaming experience!\r\n\r\n<h1>Powerful Game Booster!</h1>\r\n\r\nThe one and only Gaming Mode app on Play Store comes with a nifty set of features to enhance your gaming experience. Configure it once, and Gaming Mode will automatically do the rest for you. <b>Your ultimate game booster tool.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>How does it work?</b>\r\nYou can configure various settings that will get applied automatically when the game starts. You can configure these settings globally or on a per-game basis. Gaming Mode booster also remembers your existing device settings and restores them after your gameplay session ends. Now you no longer need to fiddle with your device settings before each gameplay session. \r\n\r\n<b>What features does it configure automatically?</b>\r\n\u2713 Auto Reject Incoming calls - Our game booster is on your side. Show your skills without interruptions.\r\n\u2713 Block notifications - With Game Booster, your focus will not be disrupted - pure gaming experience.\r\n\u2713 Game Booster\r\n\u2713 Disable auto-brightness & optimize it to your desired level.\r\n\u2713 Change WiFi state.\r\n\u2713 Change Ringtone & Media Volume.\r\n\u2713 Create widgets to launch games directly from your device's home screen. Your game launcher.\r\n\r\n<b>Create widget - Game launcher</b>\r\nEase of use with the widget on your home screen will make the start of your gaming experience even more enjoyable. The game launcher on your home screen - sweet! Instead of spending your time looking for games, enjoy playing, use our widget feature - game launcher.\r\n\r\nOur app is designed to enhance the gaming experience. One of our core features is allowing users to block internet connection to focus on their game without interruptions. This is done using a local VPN service that does not transfer data outside the device.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ultimate Game Mode.<br>Play your favorite games like a PRO. Use our game booster and enjoy a fantastic gaming experience!<br><br><h1>Powerful Game Booster!</h1><br><br>The one and only Gaming Mode app on Play Store comes with a nifty set of features to enhance your gaming experience. Configure it once, and Gaming Mode will automatically do the rest for you. <b>Your ultimate game booster tool.</b><br><br><b>How does it work?</b><br>You can configure various settings that will get applied automatically when the game starts. You can configure these settings globally or on a per-game basis. Gaming Mode booster also remembers your existing device settings and restores them after your gameplay session ends. Now you no longer need to fiddle with your device settings before each gameplay session. <br><br><b>What features does it configure automatically?</b><br>\u2713 Auto Reject Incoming calls - Our game booster is on your side. Show your skills without interruptions.<br>\u2713 Block notifications - With Game Booster, your focus will not be disrupted - pure gaming experience.<br>\u2713 Game Booster<br>\u2713 Disable auto-brightness &amp; optimize it to your desired level.<br>\u2713 Change WiFi state.<br>\u2713 Change Ringtone &amp; Media Volume.<br>\u2713 Create widgets to launch games directly from your device&#39;s home screen. Your game launcher.<br><br><b>Create widget - Game launcher</b><br>Ease of use with the widget on your home screen will make the start of your gaming experience even more enjoyable. The game launcher on your home screen - sweet! Instead of spending your time looking for games, enjoy playing, use our widget feature - game launcher.<br><br>Our app is designed to enhance the gaming experience. One of our core features is allowing users to block internet connection to focus on their game without interruptions. This is done using a local VPN service that does not transfer data outside the device.",
